# Copy to .env (never commit .env).
# ERDDAP server used for NASA/JPL MUR SST (jplMURSST41, jplMURSST41anom1day). Default:
# ERDDAP_BASE=https://coastwatch.pfeg.noaa.gov/erddap
# Same, for live mode in the browser (Vite exposes only VITE_* variables; must be a public, no-login server):
# VITE_ERDDAP_BASE=https://coastwatch.pfeg.noaa.gov/erddap
# No NASA credentials are needed: POWER, ORNL DAAC MODIS, GIBS and SVS are open. Never put Earthdata
# passwords or tokens in VITE_* variables: those are compiled into the public bundle.
